{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 36, :comments ["<b>Shelumiel son of Tzurishaddai.</b> It alludes to Shimon, that El paid him back for the sin of Yosef and cast him into custody, and also for what HaShem paid him back in the matter of Zimri — <b>Tzurishaddai:</b> that HaShem said to consume us, 'enough' (dai), as it is written (Numbers 25:8): ״וַתֵּעָצַר הַמַּגֵּפָה״."], :book :numbers, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T20:06:38.050243932Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}